  'ভিআইপি ও দূরপাল্লার কোচ টার্মিনাল', 'Thanthania, Sherpur Road, Bogura Sadar, Bogura 5800', 'বগুড়া সদর', 'Bogura''s primary terminal for premium AC and non-AC intercity luxury coaches heading towards Dhaka, Chattogram, Sylhet, and Cox''s Bazar. Flagship counters of Shah Fateh Ali, Shyamoli, Hanif, SR Travels, and TR Travels operate here.',
  '["Bogura – Dhaka (Mohakhali, Gabtoli, Abdullahpur, Sayedabad)","Bogura – Chattogram – Cox''s Bazar","Bogura – Sylhet – Moulvibazar","Bogura – Cumilla – Feni – Noakhali"]'::jsonb, '["Air-conditioned VIP passenger waiting rooms","Online ticket print & digital booking desks","Luggage storage & parcel delivery services","Snack stalls, tea stalls & pharmacy","Dedicated taxi & auto pickup points"]'::jsonb, '24/7 (first morning departure 5:30 AM – late night sleeper coaches)',
