  'রেলওয়ে স্টেশন', 'Station Road, Satmatha (Near Fateh Ali Bazar), Bogura Sadar, Bogura 5800', 'বগুড়া সদর', 'Historic central railway station serving Bogura city. Connects Dhaka via Jamuna Bridge Link, and links northern destinations including Rangpur, Lalmonirhat, Kurigram, and Burimari via Santahar junction.',
  '["Bogura – Dhaka (Kamalapur / Airport)","Bogura – Santahar Junction","Bogura – Gaibandha – Rangpur","Bogura – Lalmonirhat – Burimari","Bogura – Kurigram"]'::jsonb, '["Ticket reservation counters (standard & online Shohoz validation)","1st class & general passenger waiting rooms","Railway police (GRP) station","Parcel & freight cargo booking office","Tea & food stalls, book stalls","Covered platform footbridge"]'::jsonb, 'Open 24 hours (aligned with scheduled train arrivals)',
  '+880 51-65042', '["+880 51-65042","+880 51-75042","+880 51-65082","131"]'::jsonb, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1474487548417-781cb71495f3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80'
