  'মহাসড়ক জংশন ও বাস স্ট্যান্ড', 'Banani, Dhaka–Bogura Highway & Bypass Intersection, Bogura 5800', 'বগুড়া সদর / শাজাহানপুর', 'The southern gateway to Bogura city where the Dhaka–Rangpur national highway intersects the Bogura town bypass. High-frequency stop for all passing intercity coaches, highway motels, and local transport.',
  '["Bogura City – Dhaka Highway","Bogura Bypass – Rangpur Road","Bogura – Natore – Pabna","Bogura – Sirajganj"]'::jsonb, '["Highway coach passenger pickup counters","SR Travels, TR Travels, Agomony Express counters","Highway filling stations & EV fast chargers","Ambulance & 24/7 vehicle breakdown towing support","Hotel Siesta & Parjatan Motel proximity"]'::jsonb, '24/7',
  '+880 1726-557929', '["+880 1726-557929","+880 1991-177432","+880 51-65333","+880 51-51262"]'::jsonb, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519003722824-194d4455a60c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80'
