  'উত্তর প্রবেশদ্বার ও হাইওয়ে টার্মিনাল', 'Matidali, Rangpur Road, Northern Entrance of Bogura City, Bogura 5800', 'বগুড়া সদর', 'The landmark northern crossroads of Bogura, featuring the iconic fighter aircraft sculpture. All northbound buses heading to Rangpur, Dinajpur, Gaibandha, and tourist spots like Mahasthangarh pass through here.',
