  'শহরের প্রাণকেন্দ্র ও লোকাল ট্রান্সপোর্ট হাব', 'Satmatha, Bogura City Centre, Bogura 5800', 'বগুড়া সদর', 'The pulsating geographical heart of Bogura where seven arterial roads converge. Houses major bus ticket booking corporate offices, auto-rickshaws, bike rentals, and direct access to government offices and market hubs.',
  '["Sherpur Road (to Thanthania, Banani, Dhaka)","Rangpur Road (to Matidali, Mahasthangarh)","Santahar Road (to Charmatha, Rail Station)","Nawabbari Road (to Runner Plaza, Karatoa river)","Park Road (to Pouro Park, Judge Court)"]'::jsonb, '["Head booking offices of major luxury bus lines","Town easybike and auto-rickshaw central stands","Traffic police headquarters and help desk","ATM booths, exchange & top retail centers","Bogura Doi, sweetmeat and dining hubs"]'::jsonb, '24/7 (peak activity 6:00 AM – 11:30 PM)',
