  'উপজেলা বাস টার্মিনাল', 'Sherpur Town, Dhaka–Bogura Highway, Sherpur, Bogura 5840', 'শেরপুর', 'Southern sub-district transit hub on the main Dhaka–Bogura highway. Major halt point for buses and travelers commuting between Bogura, Sirajganj, and Dhaka.',
