  'উপজেলা বাস টার্মিনাল', 'Bogura–Naogaon Highway, Dupchanchia, Bogura 5880', 'দুপচাঁচিয়া', 'Key western transit terminal connecting Bogura Sadar with Naogaon district and Joypurhat. Facilitates seamless agricultural and passenger traffic between western upazilas and the district headquarters.',
  '["Bogura – Dupchanchia – Naogaon","Dupchanchia – Akkelpur – Joypurhat","Dupchanchia – Talora Railway Station"]'::jsonb, '["Direct bus counters for Dhaka and Naogaon routes","Local electric three-wheeler and microbus stand","Market and commercial shopping centers"]'::jsonb, '5:30 AM – 10:30 PM',
