VALUES (
  'sr-travels', 'SR Travels (SR Group)', 'এস আর ট্রাভেলস', 'intercity_bus',
  'প্রিমিয়াম আন্তঃজেলা বাস সার্ভিস', 'Sherpur Road / Banani, Bogura', 'https://srtravels-bd.com/',
  'Headquartered in Bogura, SR Travels (part of SR Group) is a pioneer in North Bengal long-route transport. Known for Scania Multi-Axle, Volvo, and Hino RM2 luxury coaches connecting Bogura with Dhaka, Chattogram, Benapole, and Rangpur.', '["Scania Multi-Axle & Volvo B9R/B11R luxury sleeper & seating coaches","Central AC with individual ventilation nozzles & reading lights","On-board CCTV, GPS safety and emergency assistance","Own highway food complex at Food Village Ltd. (Sherpur)","Spacious luggage holds & parcel booking facilities"]'::jsonb, '["Bogura – Dhaka (Gabtoli / Mohakhali / Uttara / Kalyanpur)","Bogura – Chattogram","Bogura – Benapole (Land Port)","Bogura – Rangpur – Dinajpur – Panchagarh"]'::jsonb,
  '[{"counter_name":"Banani Main Counter","location":"Banani, Dhaka–Bogura Highway, Bogura","phone_numbers":["01991-177432","051-65333"]},{"counter_name":"Satmatha Counter","location":"TMSS Mohila Market, Satmatha, Bogura","phone_numbers":["01405-575252","01711-394802"]},{"counter_name":"Sherpur Bus Stand Counter","location":"Sherpur, Bogura","phone_numbers":["01712-568356","051-88055"]},{"counter_name":"Mokamtola Counter","location":"Mokamtola, Shibganj, Bogura","phone_numbers":["01991-177435"]}]'::jsonb, '+880 1991-177432', '["+880 1991-177432","+880 1405-575252","+880 1711-394802","+880 51-65333","+880 51-88055"]'::jsonb, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570125909232-eb263c188f7e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80'
